# UI System

## Source Of Truth

- Use `packages/ui` for shells, layouts, shared components, and shadcn/ui primitives.
- Read `packages/ui/src/index.ts` before UI work to confirm exported components.
- Read matching files in `packages/ui/src/components/ui/<name>.tsx` before using a primitive.
- Add missing primitives or shared compositions to `packages/ui` before portal adoption.
- Do not use Figma MCP or block implementation on Figma node IDs.

## Visual Standards

- Typography: Geist Sans via `--font-sans`; Geist Mono via `--font-mono`; ERP body text defaults to `text-sm`.
- Colors: shadcn CSS variables from `packages/ui/styles/globals.css`; do not invent one-off hex colors.
- Density: compact admin screens, `py-4` sections, sticky table headers, skeleton loaders for tables.
- Icons: use the icon family already established by `packages/ui`; do not mix icon sets inside one surface.
- Dark mode: support light and dark from first implementation.

## Portal Shells

- `apps/admin`: `AdminShell`.
- `apps/merchant`: `MerchantShell`.
- `apps/store`: `StoreShell`.
- `apps/distributor`: `DistributorShell`.

## Accessibility

- Target WCAG 2.1 AA contrast.
- Use semantic HTML, visible labels, keyboard navigation, visible focus states, and text plus color for status.
- Mobile bind and checkout flows need 44px minimum touch targets.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` for transitions.
